# Keycloak-URL: im Dev-Modus (Dev Services) und mit eigenem Container Port 8180.
# Client-Secret: "secret" (siehe quarkus-realm.json / application.properties)

### Access-Token für susi (Rolle user) holen -> {{token}}
POST http://localhost:8180/realms/quarkus-realm/protocol/openid-connect/token
Authorization: Basic quarkus-client secret
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

username=susi&password=passme&grant_type=password

> {% client.global.set("token", response.body.access_token); %}

### Students lesen -> 200
GET http://localhost:8080/students
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Ohne Token -> 401
GET http://localhost:8080/students

### Als susi anlegen -> 403 (nur admin)
POST http://localhost:8080/students
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{ "userid": "it1000", "firstname": "Gerald", "lastname": "Aistleitner" }
